#: bathsheba_bath/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "BATHTUB"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Most everything in your home is pretty standard—you may have inherited a lovely one, but it's not exactly what anyone would call luxurious."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "So when you find yourself bowled over by the nearly suffocating air of luxury and privilege in your bathroom, it's easy enough to pinpoint the source."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A beautiful stranger in a luxurious sud-lined bathrobe stands before you, resplendent in black and gold. Her hair and skin have a distinct shine to them, as though she'd just stepped out of the bath."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She strides forward, grabbing you by the arm."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh my god, it's about time you showed up!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/40
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I ordered HOURS ago and the pizza's free if you're late-"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/48
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Wait a minute... where's my pizza?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pizza?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well now I'm hungry."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let go of me."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "If you don't know what a pizza is I'm not going to explain it to you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But man you are NOT good at your job."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yeah, and SO AM I!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "SO WHERE'S THE PIZZA!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "PRODUCE THE PIZZA AND I WILL!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She squints at you, looking you up and down."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Wait... wait. You look... familiar."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Don't I know you?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I walk by you numerous times every day."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I sure hope you do... this is my house."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I own this house..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh! Oh my God, that's you! Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She laughs, her entire demeanor changing."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Hey cutie, it's about time you came to introduce yourself to the queen of clean!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Name's Bathsheba, though I'm SURE you know that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Still don't know where my pizza is... but that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You're here now, so you can go get me one!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/51/s/0 bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure are comfortable giving orders."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get it yourself."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Huh? Why not?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Do you want me to starve to death?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Of course you don't!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well yeah... I AM a princess."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But not literally, but basically."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I can't do that!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It's all kinds of nasty out there! I could crack..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "And wouldn't you feel bad then?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well fine, if you're not gonna feed me, maybe you can FEED me."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You got any good goss for me? Some nice hot tea?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't you ask your friends for that?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really need to work on your people skills."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not into that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well sure, I mean, I have TONS of friends... Ms. Popular here, that's me!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But you're here now... and they're all so far away..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "My very, very real friends, of which there are many."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well I'm not a people! Is it really my fault I don't have people skills?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Sounds like it's YOUR fault, people."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well you should be! There's nothing like a good cup of tea!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "If you're not gonna help me you should find me someone who will."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Alright, since you're so unwilling to help little ol' me..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/8/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You should use those people-y people skills of yours to get me some friends who will!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/11/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You should ask those special glasses of yours to get me some friends who will!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If only to get you off my back."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to help."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "OHHH GOODIE!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "We'll start next time I see you then... and bring a gift next time, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/first_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It's just good manners, you know."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba is deep into a novel of some sort when you see her—it must be salacious, because she's gasping and fanning herself."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ugh, enough of the will-they-won't-they! Get you some fan, girl!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh, just kiss her! Come on!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you reading?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kiss who?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want me to kiss you?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba starts, throwing the book your way with a shriek."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "AAAAAGHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a closer look at the book—a ceiling fan and a pedestal fan, each with varying amounts of cleavage, stand chest to chest in a pose that lets you know right away this is a steamy romance novel."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh man, can I borrow this?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell is this?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This looks fun."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I wasn't done with it, but sure, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I do have EXCELLENT taste, don't I?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It's FUN is what!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well, if you're gonna be a prude, you can just give it back."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Whatever. I'm bored already. Keep it."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It IS fun, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You can hold onto it if you want."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba places a hand on her chest, batting her eyelashes at you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Soooo? We gonna get to making me some friends?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh, yay!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Ugh, whatever."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Okay. I'm not into walking, so let's just stick around here, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks around the room, her gaze settling on the toilet."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh, how about Jean Loo?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you turn your dateviatored gaze on the toilet it springs to life."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/41
msgctxt "Jean Loo"
msgid "You interrupt Lil' Crapper's peace, what could you want? You honk like sick geese, your-"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/52
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Mmmm that's enough of that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba steers you away before the rapping toilet can complete his verse."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/78
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Hm, maybe someone a little more beautiful and delicate... You know, someone who can keep up with me."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba looks around the room, her gaze finally settling on someone standing by the counter."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/94
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oooh, Barry!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/102
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba waves at Barry, who gives her a surprised but enthusiastic little wave back. She greets him with an air kiss to each cheek, which he returns with the same sort of energy."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/119
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "What's this now? Is it my birthday and no one told me?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/130
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "The fabulous Bathsheba come to consort with my humble self?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/138
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh come on, Barry, I see you all the time."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/146
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Yes, but do you speak to me, darling?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/154
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Aren't we like, beyond words?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/162
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Mmm... I wouldn't go that far."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/170/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ignore Barry?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/171/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If I was as fabulous as you I'd ignore him too."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/172/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should be kinder to the things around you..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "No way!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Every day."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/23
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Barry, sweetie, baby... it's just that I'm like, SO fabulous it's hard."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7 bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "EXACTLY!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I mean, I don't, I'm a tub of the people. But yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/23
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Oh... off to a wonderful start, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "It's about time someone said so."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "<i>I</i> don't need a thing from her, you understand."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "But a little courtesy goes a long way!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Listen, listen. Barry honey, there's no reason you and I shouldn't be close."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I mean, we're both beautiful and we love things that make you beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Instant besties, right?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Well... it would be nice to have someone to talk to about my latest obsessions."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Today it's snail mucin! You wouldn't believe the limitless beauty applications snail mucin has!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "SNAIL mucin? Is that what it sounds like?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Be nice."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just let him explain."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "EWWW."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I AM BEING NICE!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "SOMEONE SHOULD TELL HIM WHEN SOMETHING IS NASTY SO HE DOESN'T EMBARRASS HIMSELF!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/23
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "It's far from nasty, darling."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh, fine."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I KNOW GOD!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Wow... Real mature."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Are you going to allow me to explain or would you rather this conversation ended here?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks at you, desperation in her gaze."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please continue, Barry."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should probably stop there."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-4/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Barry. Go on."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "As I was saying, snail mucin is a truly wondrous product."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "It's truly miraculous when it comes to dry skin."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Here, why don't you try just this little bit? This snail mucin essence will make you a true believer."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He holds a small jar out to you, dipping a small applicator into it and lifting it up, letting the product slowly drip back down into the jar."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's not the most appealing sight."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/54
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I think I'm going to be sick. I'm out!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba flees, leaving you and Barry alone."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/73
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "...don't suppose you'd like to try the essence?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get that shit away from me."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "Well. At least someone around here is open-minded..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/second_encounter/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Barry"
msgid "I see. Well I've nothing more to say here, then."
msgstr ""

