#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Bathsheba, my darling... I am truly blessed by your beauty."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh my god, stoooop..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "No no, it is true. Just look at yourself."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/62
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "The way your just-bathed curls frame your perfect face, the gentle peek of your décolletage from your robe."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Class and sass in equal measure."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/78
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "God I LIKE you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She IS pretty but we're not here for flattery, Amir."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're supposed to be practicing your social skills."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/88/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you actually believe any of this crap?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It is not FLATTERY. A mirror can only reflect the truth."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And the truth I see is a beautiful bathtub who knows her worth."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "God I DO don't I."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And we are!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Hey! It's not unbelievable that I'm fine!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "You said you are practicing social skills, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Learning to take a compliment with poise and grace is a social skill!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yes, YES!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Let us have an example now."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Bathsheba... you may be the most beautiful bathtub I have ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I could live a thousand years and reflect a thousand souls... but never would I see your equal again."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Amir-"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/56
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "A-bup-bup-bup-bup!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He turns to you with a dazzling smile."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/72
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Now then... how does a woman of Bathsheba's immense beauty respond to such a sweet and effusive compliment?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you sir, may I have another?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Duh. Tell me something I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's so kind... thank you so much."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "What am I, a thirsty Victorian child begging for compliment porridge?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How awful."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "No way!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "How wonderful... I love to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "That's... nice I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "A little too demure for a queen like me. But nice."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/29
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Humility is for peasants. Royalty knows their value!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Okay but like... what if someone <i>doesn't</i> compliment me?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Is such a thing possible when you look the way you do?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Possible AND overwhelmingly likely."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't go through life expecting everyone to worship you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You tell them to take another look at your fine self and change their approach."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh! Boo!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Sure I can!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'm a grown bathtub, if they can't recognize my devastating beauty..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'll just go talk to someone else!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/37
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Gorgeous, yes. Just beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Hm, now that's advice I can take."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "It suits a tub of your unparalleled grace."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/29
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "If they cannot treat you the way you deserve then you will let them know."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/37
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "And if they still cannot, simply walk away!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "God we should have just started with you, Amir."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You really know what's what."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I am only a reflection of you—all that taste is yours."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You see what I mean?! He gets it."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "What a great time."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We learned so much today, wow."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad you had fun today."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Glad we could waste time listening to Amir's flattery."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "We really did!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Not that I needed to learn anything, but yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'm definitely gonna make an army of friends who think I'm hot now."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/37
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "I can see no other future for you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I did, yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/21
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "As did I... always a pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Amir"
msgid "Excuse you... it is NOT flattery and it is NEVER a waste!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "YEAH! IT'S THE TRUTH AND IT'S AN EXCELLENT USE OF TIME!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Today was perfect. Let's make sure we match Amir's energy next time."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You can go now!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Amir... sweetie... tell me some more nice things about me..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba looks, for the first time since you've met her, sad and entirely unenergetic."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She sighs when she sees you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/22/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh... glad it's you. You always know the right thing to say."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/25/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh... hey."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/28/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh great, it's you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh... did someone forget to compliment you?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, rude."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "...everything."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh... sorry. Hi or whatever."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Talking to Amir was like, so great."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/0/b/9
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I was like wow, I could use this experience again."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "So I went around the house, you know, using all the lessons I learned from you..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could you repeat those for me?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What exactly do you think those lessons were?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh boy..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "One: Tell others they're being annoying."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Two: Whenever you have something shady to say, say it."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/16/b/1
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Three: Make sure your future friend compliments you constantly."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're telling me that didn't make you any friends?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't understand why that didn't work."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That is NOT what I taught you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It didn't... and worse..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I can't either! And that's not even all."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Yes it is... I was paying attention."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You need to take responsibility for what you've done."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "YOUR little friendship lessons made me ENEMIES!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I thought I was going to get COMPLIMENTS and I got INSULTS AND REJECTION!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't deserve that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you need to try a different approach."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's what you deserve, really."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her lip trembles as her eyes fill with tears."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I don't! I... I really don't!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Like what? <i>Humility</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "No one would ever ask a princess to be humble!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It's not in me!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "WHAT I DESERVE IS COMPLIMENTS AND DELICIOUS GOSSIP SHARED WITH ME WHENEVER I ASK!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I don't get it!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Everyone around HERE is so easy to talk to and they know just who I am..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Well, most everyone is."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I wasn't expecting the rest of the house to be so..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "MEAN!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Welcome to the real world."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish I could tell you life isn't like that, but it is."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't control what others think of you... don't make it your problem."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "IF THIS IS THE REAL WORLD YOU CAN KEEP IT!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I'M JUST GONNA STAY HERE!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Okay but like, you could tell me that anyway."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "It would be nice to hear it!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "...I don't know how to do that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I wish I could, but I don't know how."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Look, unless you've got some good tea for me..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Or you're gonna tell me how pretty I am..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I just wanna be alone."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I heard Jean Loo's upcoming album has been delayed again."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're the most beautiful tub I've ever seen in my life."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh my god just go then."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh... that is pretty good."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "But I'm still sad."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "I just need a little time for me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/fifth_encounter/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Let's talk later."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bathsheba is back to her usual happiness, though her energy is softer than when you first met her."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She greets you with enthusiastic kisses to your cheek, her lips actually making contact with your face."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Look who it is! My favorite human being!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem... happier."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everything better now?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/0 bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_friend/0/16
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You know, I was sitting here in the bath feeling sorry for myself..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/8 bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_friend/0/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "After the real tragedy I went through when some of the objects in this house were MEAN to me..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/16 bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_friend/0/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "And I couldn't help but think about you."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You who knew a good thing when you saw it, a gem of a tub really."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "And I thought to myself, hey!"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Who needs a bunch of friends when you've got somebody here who knows how great you are?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Maybe I don't need a hundred friends."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Maybe I only need like, 2 good ones and one AMAZING one."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A BEST friend, really."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I really only a friend to you?"
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I better be the 'AMAZING' one..."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "Oh honey... you're so much more than that."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a look in her eyes you've only seen when she's staring at her own reflection."
msgstr ""

#: bathsheba_bath/bathsheba_love/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Bathsheba"
msgid "You were an amazing friend, yes..."
msgstr ""

